mission "A Scholar Without a Flag"
    name "A Scholar Without a Flag"
    description "Meet Doctor Inez Salvatierra and learn why she is buying every chart of the western shoals."
    source "Bellweather Cay"
    destination "Port de Lune"
    reward 875
    speaker offer "Doctor Inez Salvatierra"
    speaker visit "Doctor Inez Salvatierra"
    speaker complete "Doctor Inez Salvatierra"
    to offer
        has "The Monk Who Burned His Maps: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Doctor Inez Salvatierra has filled one end of the room with charts of the western shoals. Several bear fresh annotations; others have been bought from captains who would rather not say where they found them.`
            `Inez sets two charts side by side. "I am buying every copy I can find because they disagree in exactly the wrong places. The missing passages are not mistakes. It looks as though someone has been correcting the sea on paper."`
            choice
                `"I will take the job. Mark the place on my chart."`
                    accept
                `"What exactly are you afraid will happen?"`
                    goto details
                `"Keep me out of it. I have other waters to sail."`
                    close
            label details
                `She turns one of the charts toward you. "I need another pair of eyes, captain. A scholar can compare marks until the ink runs, but someone who has sailed these shoals can tell a false channel from a dangerous one."`
                choice
                    `"I will take the next leg. Give me the heading."`
                        accept
                    `"I will keep clear of this matter. Good luck."`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted A Scholar Without a Flag. Meet Doctor Inez Salvatierra and learn why she is buying every chart of the western shoals."
    on visit
        conversation
            `At Port de Lune, Inez lays your chart beside the others. The old expedition's route begins to emerge, but its destination has been cut from every official copy. "They were not searching for gold alone," she says. "Someone has spent a long time making sure we never learn what they found."`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Inez gathers the charts into a leather case. "I owe you more than a fee. Each copy was only a fragment; together they are beginning to tell the same story. I would rather the truth reached the islands before another flag lays claim to it."`
        log "Completed A Scholar Without a Flag. Received 875 gold. Meet Doctor Inez Salvatierra and learn why she is buying every chart of the western shoals."
